  "translation": "Yesterday was the weekend. My friend and I went to the park together. The weather was really nice. We first flew kites on the grass. The kites flew very high. Then we went to the lakeside and took a walk. There were ducks in the lake. The photos we took were beautiful. At noon we ate under a tree. I ate a sandwich, and my friend ate fruit. In the afternoon we took a bus home. Everyone was very happy. This weekend was great! I hope I can come again next time."
